# MongoDB Connection String:
# Note: In Node.js v26+, Node's internal c-ares DNS resolver has a known bug with SRV queries (querySrv EBADRESP).
# If mongodb+srv:// fails, use the standard replica set URI format provided by MongoDB Atlas:
# Standard replica set format:
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://<username>:<password>@ac-vdr3vyg-shard-00-00.eoqkvgj.mongodb.net:27017,ac-vdr3vyg-shard-00-01.eoqkvgj.mongodb.net:27017,ac-vdr3vyg-shard-00-02.eoqkvgj.mongodb.net:27017/<database>?ssl=true&replicaSet=atlas-p1cmff-shard-0&authSource=admin&retryWrites=true&w=majority
